# TaskForge

## Overview

TaskForge is an intelligent productivity automation tool designed for developers, students, and remote workers. It analyzes user activities, organizes project files, creates daily schedules, and generates progress summaries automatically.

## Features

* Smart file organization by type and project.
* AI-generated daily task planning.
* Work session tracking with focus timers.
* Automatic project progress reports.
* Cross-platform support (Windows, Linux, macOS).
* Export reports to Markdown and PDF.
* Git integration for tracking coding activity.

## Technology Stack

* Python 3.12+
* SQLite
* OpenAI API (optional)
* Rich CLI
* Typer
* Pandas

## Example Commands

```bash
taskforge organize
taskforge plan
taskforge focus 45
taskforge report
```

